<h2>Nalika Cilik</h2>
Nalika Cilik.
Nalika yuswanipun pitung taun, Evelyn sinau balèt dhateng Y. Jaquet, lajeng sinau tari Sunda dhateng R. T. Sumantri. Piyambakipun ugi sinau nyanyi dhateng Mrs. T. Borst (ingkang lulusan saking Konservatorium &lt;a href="Amsterdam"&gt;Amsterdam&lt;/a&gt; ing nagari &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;), Mrs. G. Roverger (Lulusan saking &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;), saha Ms. Yu I Hsuen (saking China Central Music Conservatorium ing &lt;a href="Peking%2C%20China"&gt;Peking, China&lt;/a&gt;). 
